WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.205
How to play: Gawa Ko 'To!

2
00:00:02.205 --> 00:00:07.716
Pick a picture, a slogan and a health fact. The poster builds as you pick.

3
00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:14.227
A real person's face or voice needs their permission first. Use the Ask permission step, and listen to the answer.

4
00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:18.729
Anything an AI made gets the "Made with AI" label.

5
00:00:18.729 --> 00:00:24.234
Health facts must be correct. Wrong ones, even tempting ones, get the poster reported.

6
00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:28.748
Briefs get tougher: the captain may ask for a certain picture or for the AI tool’s slogan.

7
00:00:28.748 --> 00:00:33.760
An artist's drawing needs the artist's name on it.

8
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:38.275
Now it is your turn. Have fun!
